  <item>
    <title>【No.38】在大同，白天读历史，夜晚享烟火</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab4d995195d838e2ae9a85f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab4d995195d838e2ae9a85f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>内容摘要：</span></strong><span>本期《旅事不爽》来到山西大同，小红秘书邀请刚结束大同之旅的同事清风畅聊这座古都：从免费开放的古城墙 City Walk，到震撼人心的云冈石窟；从坐拥中国八大辽构的华严寺、善化寺，到烟火气十足的东南邑步行街。两人还分享了喜晋道刀削面、干炸丸子、沙葱浇莜面等美食体验，以及景区官方直通车、错峰出行等实用攻略，直呼大同是 "好吃不贵、有文化又凉快" 的宝藏旅居城市，值得静下心来住上几天慢慢品味。</span></p><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>小红秘书</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>清风（小红秘书的同事）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUCUjqG01BDxHM48Ep-P5NM7stz.jpg"><p><span>云冈石窟第5窟（大佛洞）</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoiRb9j8qin4LmnKbTdMczVHBb8C.jpg"><p><strong><span>云冈石窟第6窟（释迦佛洞）&nbsp;：</span></strong><span>被誉为“云冈第一伟观”</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMeVInrff_QHIi0uQOIm71mBJPO.jpg"><p><strong><span>云冈石窟第20窟（露天大佛），</span></strong><span>云冈最标志性的名片</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmn31G-apr6NruImKxMJ9FlEt7QI.jpg"><p><span>大同古城城墙</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtK6XMey04a6-MFtkYVcbQLQgOxR.jpg"><p><span>古城十字路口的魁星楼</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLmZtidqsGMUpgDN7beJ-CvhqP_.jpg"><p><span>华严寺薄伽教藏殿（八大辽构之一）</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCPGK7sFgUS4TDCw6R4NbVzzLGi.jpg"><p><span>华严寺大雄宝殿</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlqcfWyH1xsDNALP9KnzDmOxFEhq.jpg"><p><span>善化寺大雄宝殿内的藻井</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmbiw_oexcRgulKoSAau7BBV2fjE.jpg"><p><span>善化寺大雄宝殿内吉祥天女塑像</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FisE2726KJ6JitfM8xfjgobAHo6l.jpg"><p><span>干炸丸子，巨好吃</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujDMz7iUaTpLG39g_ZMMAVVIKFM.jpg"><p><span>熏兔肉</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhegaqs4aQwlWpFf8Ma9sM6OnJWz.jpg"><p><span>喜晋道的刀削面</span><strong><span>▲</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>合作、投稿以及反馈：422452213@qq.com</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>您同时可以在苹果播客、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、云听车载APP找到我们，欢迎订阅收听节目！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
