    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>内容摘要：</span></strong><span>本期《旅事不爽》，小红秘书与嘉宾小石畅聊山西之旅。晋祠、山西博物院、北齐壁画博物馆、五台山，分享古建彩塑、壁画见闻与头脑、剔尖、刀削面等美食体验，还穿插古碑 "工作留痕"、供果 "开智灵果" 等趣事，讲述真实旅行感受全记录，干货与吐槽并存。</span></p><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>小红秘书</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>小石（小红秘书的小兄弟）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpyQXiRNZmHM904PPgl7UDpMXfAP.jpg"><p><strong><span>晋祠的标志性建筑▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FixdIyr_Ads4f7tiFI85uvJeeu4N.jpg"><p><strong><span>晋祠最经典的打卡机位▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGdJbIZ0Py1jpPpvHX4XlvWB5DJ.jpg"><p><strong><span>圣母殿内供奉的圣母塑像（北宋元祐二年，1087年）▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmxp36wADhCIDW2ufL3MDa86nsx1.jpg"><p><strong><span>圣母殿背后，抚摸千年顶梁柱▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuRFe2DRn349S7ej_utVyZdrWeqp.jpg"><p><strong><span>山西省博物院顶流青铜器——晋侯鸟尊▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fooq3z97d0PDvpjmA4nPjt-bLJP8.jpg"><p><strong><span>五台山一景▲</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FovciDHVPYRJRYF57N-NNKgcjTbN.jpg"><p><strong><span>五台山一景▲</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>合作、投稿以及反馈：422452213@qq.com</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>您同时可以在苹果播客、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、云听车载APP找到我们，欢迎订阅收听节目！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
